PUT {{baseUrl}}/site
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "水培技术网",
  "url": "https://hydroponics.com",
  "description": "专业水培技术分享平台",
  "logo": "https://example.com/logo.png"
}

### 8.3 Get Theme Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/site/theme/schema

