### 9. Menu Module Tests
###############################################

### 9.1 Create Menu Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "label": "首页",
  "sectionType": "PAGE",
  "order": 1,
  "isVisible": true
}

### 9.2 Get All Menu Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu
